            <ArticleTitle>Triple balloon-on-a-wire or &quot;ménage à trois&quot; coronary angioplasty.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>76-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We have described here the triple balloon or &quot;ménage à trois&quot; technique of coronary angioplasty of trifurcation lesions or closely approximated bifurcation lesions. Although the need for this technique is uncommon on anatomic grounds, it can facilitate excellent angiographic results.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
